  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Project support to Operation Aid&#x2019;s project Active Kids during 2025. The project aims to rehabilitate and improve the health of children in Ukraine who suffer from trauma, have lost a parent or in other ways have been affected by Russia&#x2019;s full-scale invasion.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Projektst&#xf6;d till Operation Aids projekt Active Kids under 2025. Projektet syftar till att rehabilitera och f&#xf6;rb&#xe4;ttra h&#xe4;lsan f&#xf6;r barn i Ukraina som traumatiserats, f&#xf6;rlorat f&#xf6;r&#xe4;ldrar eller p&#xe5; andra s&#xe4;tt p&#xe5;verkats av Rysslands fullskaliga invasion.</narrative>
